Package: NAFOSDM
Title: NAFO Regulatory Area Species Distribution Models under Climate Change Projections
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Analysis project (not an installable package). This file lists
    the R packages needed to run the scripts in code/, so they can be
    installed without renv, e.g. with pak::local_install_deps() or
    remotes::install_deps(dependencies = TRUE). Imports are needed by the
    core workflow (code/00_CodeCaller.R and the scripts it sources);
    Suggests are needed only by code/01_DataCleanup (gsw, ncdf4, R.utils)
    and code/02_Exploratory.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
